From: iOSPlus10 GPU-recovery agent
Subject: [PATCH] negroni gpu: KGSL gen7 parity from the 2026-10-26 audit (0298)

docs/audit/2026-10-26-gpu.md section 3, after 0287/0288 (each item has a boot-arg):
- HWCG on: 53 gen7_0_0_hwcg_regs + RBBM_CLOCK_CNTL 0x8aa8aa82 + 3 GMU AO CGC words (step 20)
- slumber from IFPC mode after negronigpu_ifpc_slumber ms idle (default 2000); slumber adds
  KGSL's GBIF halt; every warm boot flushes the SMMU TLB and clears a stale FSR first;
  IFPC is asked again after every rewake when the GMU accepted it at boot
- DCVS busy from the GMU busy power counter (XOCLK_0 over the AO counter, KGSL
  gen7_power_stats); busy tick at negronigpu_busy_pct (50); falls back to the fence rule
  if the counter does not move
- CP_PROTECT_CNTL + 45 ranges, CP_CHICKEN_DBG x3 = 1, ME_INIT BIT(11) (DMS off)
- RB_CNTL without BIT(27): the CP writes its rptr shadow; IFPC ring room from it
- HFI ack timeout 100 ms after the boot ladder (negronigpu_hfi_ms)
- a guard page after every kernel-placed GPU buffer (negronigpu_guard)
- bus votes computed from cmd-db SH0/MC0/ACV aux data + the DT bus-table-ddr, the CNOC
  CN0 vote (bus-table-cnoc), DCVS bw index = the DT bus-freq of each level
Not done: ACD (needs the AOP QMP mailbox), preemption (one ring, one priority).

